  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During the wolf tide’s fight against the thunder crown wolf, a middle-aged female Gu Yue clan elder stretches out both hands and a pure white, warm light bubbles forth, flowing first onto Gu Yue Bo’s body and then reflecting onto each of the other clan elders. This is Therapy Light Gu, a rank three healing Gu with area-of-effect properties: it can instantly stop bleeding on Gu Masters’ wounds, fully recover light wounds, and heal heavy wounds by half.",
